    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fore!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fore Score is a fast-paced multiplayer miniature golf game, with a twist! Build the hole as you play, alternating between putting the ball and placing hazards on the course, competing to score the most points while sabotaging your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/ad1082dd47136577f2de9f2840e97b38.poster.avif?t=1738949090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/ad1082dd47136577f2de9f2840e97b38.webm?t=1738949090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/ad1082dd47136577f2de9f2840e97b38.mp4?t=1738949090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finishing the hole within the time limit will award you with points. Bonus points are awarded for finishing first, fewest strokes or hitting a hole-in-one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/b7aedf09b80698736bbc6691524e995b.poster.avif?t=1738949090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/b7aedf09b80698736bbc6691524e995b.webm?t=1738949090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/b7aedf09b80698736bbc6691524e995b.mp4?t=1738949090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a golfer, then your ball, and start putting! Each round, players choose from a random selection of obstacles to modify the hole. Place down bumpers, windmills, cannons, and blocks, creating new challenges and shortcuts. First player to reach the target score will win! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build the hole as you play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/6f7b7c110857dea528cd6aaac1f485d2.poster.avif?t=1738949090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/6f7b7c110857dea528cd6aaac1f485d2.webm?t=1738949090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/6f7b7c110857dea528cd6aaac1f485d2.mp4?t=1738949090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer fun: Supports up to four players locally or using Steam Remote Play Together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique twist: Each round, players add new obstacles to the hole to make it more challenging and chaotic for your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy-to-learn controls: Fore Score is designed to be accessible and fun for players of all skill levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless possibilities: With a large variety of obstacles to choose from, no two rounds play out the same</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Notice: This game is meant for multiplayer.</strong> While you could play solo against yourself with two controllers... it is meant to be enjoyed with a friend or three! Controllers are recommended but not required.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fore!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fore Score is a fast-paced multiplayer miniature golf game, with a twist! Build the hole as you play, alternating between putting the ball and placing hazards on the course, competing to score the most points while sabotaging your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/ad1082dd47136577f2de9f2840e97b38.poster.avif?t=1738949090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/ad1082dd47136577f2de9f2840e97b38.webm?t=1738949090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/ad1082dd47136577f2de9f2840e97b38.mp4?t=1738949090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finishing the hole within the time limit will award you with points. Bonus points are awarded for finishing first, fewest strokes or hitting a hole-in-one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/b7aedf09b80698736bbc6691524e995b.poster.avif?t=1738949090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/b7aedf09b80698736bbc6691524e995b.webm?t=1738949090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/b7aedf09b80698736bbc6691524e995b.mp4?t=1738949090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a golfer, then your ball, and start putting! Each round, players choose from a random selection of obstacles to modify the hole. Place down bumpers, windmills, cannons, and blocks, creating new challenges and shortcuts. First player to reach the target score will win! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build the hole as you play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/6f7b7c110857dea528cd6aaac1f485d2.poster.avif?t=1738949090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/6f7b7c110857dea528cd6aaac1f485d2.webm?t=1738949090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554070/extras/6f7b7c110857dea528cd6aaac1f485d2.mp4?t=1738949090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer fun: Supports up to four players locally or using Steam Remote Play Together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique twist: Each round, players add new obstacles to the hole to make it more challenging and chaotic for your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy-to-learn controls: Fore Score is designed to be accessible and fun for players of all skill levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless possibilities: With a large variety of obstacles to choose from, no two rounds play out the same</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Notice: This game is meant for multiplayer.</strong> While you could play solo against yourself with two controllers... it is meant to be enjoyed with a friend or three! Controllers are recommended but not required.</p>",
    "short_description": "Fore Score is a fast-paced multiplayer miniature golf game, with a twist! Build the hole as you play, alternating between putting the ball and placing hazards on the course, competing to score the most points while sabotaging your friends. Fore!",
